---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const unit = catalog.parts[3].units[0];
const anchorFor = (sectionId) => `#section-${sectionId.replace('.', '-')}`;
---

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="chapter12-source-map-title">
  <h2 id="chapter12-source-map-title">来源地图 | Source Map</h2>
  <p>
    下面只记录目录级定位和网站覆盖状态，不转录教材正文。页码为 Martin 第 2 版印刷页码。
    <span lang="en">The table records directory-level locators and website coverage only; it does not reproduce textbook prose. Page numbers refer to the printed second edition.</span>
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>节 | Section</th>
        <th>Martin 标题 | Martin title</th>
        <th>印刷页 | Printed page</th>
        <th>网站位置 | Site position</th>
        <th>状态 | Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {unit.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}</td>
          <td lang="en">{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.page}</td>
          <td><a href={anchorFor(section.id)}>本页对应段落 | matching section</a></td>
          <td>正文与推导已填充 | body and derivations filled</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement">
    <strong>补充定位：</strong>Part IV overview，印刷页 259–261；Appendix F（扩展体系 Coulomb），607–619；Appendix L（数值方法），651–659；Appendix M（迭代方法与 FFT），661–676。Sholl–Steckel Chapters 2、4、10 只用于周期结构、表面边界和精度检查的实践连接。
  </p>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement" lang="en">
    <strong>Supplemental locators:</strong> Part IV overview, printed pp. 259–261; Appendix F on Coulomb interactions in extended systems, pp. 607–619; Appendix L on numerical methods, pp. 651–659; Appendix M on iterative methods and FFTs, pp. 661–676. Sholl–Steckel Chapters 2, 4, and 10 are used only for practical links to periodic structures, surface boundaries, and accuracy checks.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .chapter-source-map__supplement {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    border-left: 0.25rem solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
  }
</style>
